<title>AUSTRIA: UAE's Rakad says OPEC will agree to six month roll.</title>
<headline>UAE's Rakad says OPEC will agree to six month roll.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acting UAE oil minister Rakad bin Salem bin Rakad said that OPEC would agree to a six month OPEC output rollover.</p>
<p>In answer to a reporter's question if that were the case Rakad said &quot;yes.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
